 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Aircraft Hair</em></p>\n<p>You have learned the following destructive ways to amplify your <em>Aircraft Hair</em> forms:<br />\n<strong>Copter Frenzy</strong>. As an action for 5 CE, you force all creatures within 15 ft to make a Dexterity saving throw. On a failed save they take your <em>Helicopter Hair</em> damage. On a successful save, they take half as much.<br />\n<strong>Jet Crash</strong>. The damage a creature takes from impacting a solid surface from your crash increases to 1d6 per 10 ft traveled in a straight line before hitting the. This becomes 1d8 at 11th level and 1d10 at 18th level.</p>",
